.TH SIMPLE_SHELL 1 "September 2026" "Holberton School" "Simple Shell Manual"
.SH NAME
simple_shell \- a simple UNIX command line interpreter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./hsh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Simple Shell is a basic UNIX command line interpreter written in C.
It reads commands from standard input and executes them.
The shell can operate in interactive and non-interactive modes.
.SH USAGE
To start the shell in interactive mode:
.PP
.B ./hsh
.PP
Enter a command such as:
.PP
.B /bin/ls
.PP
To exit the shell, use:
.PP
.B exit
.SH COMPILATION
Compile the program using:
.PP
.B gcc -Wall -Werror -Wextra -pedantic -std=gnu89 *.c -o hsh
